ons.</p><div class="tip-divider"></div><p><strong>An example</strong><br>What is the basic unit of life?<br><span class="muted">The cell.</span></p><?php if (!$card): ?><a class="text-link" href="<?= e(url('/decks/' . ((int) $deck['id']) . '/import')) ?>">Have a collection already? Import CSV <?= icon('arrow',16) ?></a><?php endif; ?></aside></div>
